      "text": "Urban economics explains why cities exist, why they grow, why some thrive and others decline, and how economic activity distributes across space. The central puzzle: why are people and firms so much more productive when they are near each other?"
    },
    {
      "id": "06-URBAN-ECONOMICS.md#003",
