        "title": "Urban Economics",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "The fundamental question of urban economics: why do firms and workers cluster in cities when they could spread out and pay less for land?"
    },
    {
      "id": "06-URBAN-ECONOMICS.md#007",
      "path": [
        "06-URBAN-ECONOMICS.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
