      "text": "```\nTWO TYPES OF AGGLOMERATION:"
    },
    {
      "id": "06-URBAN-ECONOMICS.md#017",
      "path": [
        "06-URBAN-ECONOMICS.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
