      "text": "LOCALIZATION ECONOMIES (MAR):\n  Benefits from co-location of firms\n  in the SAME industry.\n  Named: Marshall-Arrow-Romer (MAR model).\n  Example: Detroit auto industry, Silicon\n  Valley semiconductors, Hollywood film,\n  Wall Street finance.\n  Mechanism: labor pooling + specialized\n  suppliers most important for same-industry."
    },
    {
